+# AEGIS 0.16.0 delivery package
+
+- Released: 2026-11-16
+- Runtime: Python 3.11 or newer; none embedded
+- Dependencies: Python standard library only
+- Platforms: Windows ZIP and Linux tar.gz payloads
+
+The `0.16.0` section of `CHANGELOG.md` records what this release changed.
+
+| Platform | Artifact | Bytes | SHA-256 |
+|---|---|---:|---|
+| Linux | `aegis-0.16.0-linux.tar.gz` | 175,864 | `fd759154647778bdae53628f36e956201e4473ef5972e9689c76ea8538b02917` |
+| Windows | `aegis-0.16.0-windows.zip` | 203,580 | `56e38fc8923559cf0cdebd1ce4514d6b5e1f4690612e24a5468f9430cce3bdfc` |
